About
This repository contains a compact ESPHome alarm system concept for Home Assistant integration.
It targets hardware such as an Olimex ESP32-POE-ISO, a 128x32 OLED display, a 4x3 keypad,
an RC522 NFC reader, and door contacts connected through an MCP23017 I/O expander.

Important Notice
This project was created entirely with OpenAI ChatGPT and Codex.
The code is an experiment to demonstrate what AI can build.
No warranty is provided for correctness, safety, or fitness for production use.
Use at your own risk.
